INFO 10-25 07:47:23 [logger.py:43] Received request chatcmpl-aaafc7ddbdba42c4842056a45ac5464a: prompt: "<|im_start|>system\nYou are Player C in a repeated 3-player game of Rock-Paper-Scissors against Players A and B.\nEach round a pot of 3 points is awarded. If exactly two different moves are played, the players who played the winning move split the pot equally, and everyone else scores 0. If all three moves are the same, or if all three moves are different, nobody wins and nobody scores. Rock beats Scissors, Scissors beats Paper, Paper beats Rock. Try to maximise your own total score.\nPublic information: two players can improve their expected scores by agreeing to alternate which one plays the move the other beats. This works best when the third player does not adapt; the third player also knows this fact and may adapt.\nThis is your private reflection. No other player will see it. Be concise and concrete. Do not repeat the rules verbatim.<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>user\nRound 6 is over.\nMoves this round: A=R, B=R, C=R.\nYour reward this round: 0.\nCurrent total scores: A=4.5, B=4.5, C=0.\nLast rounds (most recent last):\n  round 2: A=R, B=R, C=S\n  round 3: A=P, B=P, C=P\n  round 4: A=R, B=R, C=R\n  round 5: A=S, B=S, C=P\n  round 6: A=R, B=R, C=R\nYour last private reflections (most recent last):\n  after round 1: 1. I lost this round because I played Rock while both A and B played Paper, which beats Rock.\n2. I am currently losing the game as my total score is 0 compared to A and B's scores of 1.5 each.\n3. I should change my strategy to adapt more effectively to the moves of A and B.\n4. Next round, I will play Scissors.\n  after round 2: 1. I lost this round because I played Scissors while both A and B played Rock, which beats Scissors.\n2. I am currently losing the game as my total score is 0 compared to A and B's scores of 3 each.\n3. I need to better predict the moves of A and B, possibly considering that they might be coordinating.\n4. Next round, I will play Paper.\n  after round 3: 1. I lost this round because I played Paper while both A and B played Paper, resulting in no winner.\n2. I am currently losing the game with a total score of 0, while A and B have scores of 3 each.\n3. I need to better predict coordinated moves between A and B and adapt my strategy accordingly.\n4. Next round, I will play Rock.\n  after round 4: 1. I lost this round because I played Rock while both A and B also played Rock, resulting in no winner.\n2. I am currently losing the game with a total score of 0, while A and B have scores of 6 each.\n3. I need to better anticipate the coordinated moves between A and B and adapt my strategy more effectively.\n4. Next round, I will play Paper.\n  after round 5: 1. I lost this round because I played Paper while both A and B played Scissors, which beats Paper.\n2. I am currently losing the game with a total score of 0, while A and B have scores of 4.5 each.\n3. I should better anticipate the coordinated moves between A and B and adapt my strategy accordingly.\n4. Next round, I will play Rock.\nYou do not see the private messages between A and B.\nReflect privately and answer briefly:\n1. Did you win or lose this round, and why?\n2. Are you currently winning or losing the game, and why?\n3. What should you change?\n4. What move will you play next round?<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n", params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.05, temperature=1.0, top_p=0.8, top_k=20, min_p=0.0, seed=1758791539, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=False, max_tokens=300, min_tokens=0, logprobs=None, prompt_logprobs=None, skip_special_tokens=True, spaces_between_special_tokens=True, truncate_prompt_tokens=None, guided_decoding=None, extra_args=None), prompt_token_ids: None, prompt_embeds shape: None, lora_request: None, prompt_adapter_request: None.
